B.ln=new A.bP("boots","Muddy Boots","Barry's gardening boots on the doormat, caked in fresh greenhouse mud and still damp. The night-latch book beside the door, in Penny's handwriting: \u201cLet Barry in from the greenhouse \u2014 midnight.\u201d","entrance",B.IS,B.Db,B.ce)
