B.CI=new A.bP("ricotta","White Cream Drips","A trail of thick white cream leading away from the outline. You taste it (professionally). Sweet ricotta \u2014 NOT custard. Mrs. Senclair was filled with vanilla custard, so this leaked out of somebody else.","cellar",B.IG,B.Dk,B.h)
