B.CE=new A.bP("pin","Marble Rolling Pin","Shoved behind the boiler: a heavy marble rolling pin, hastily wiped. There is custard in the handle grooves, and a shard of crisp, bubbly, FRIED pastry shell stuck to one end.","boiler",B.IH,B.cj,B.aW)
