B.Cx=new A.bP("ledger","Debt Ledger","Mrs. Senclair's ledger, open on her desk. \u201cCol. Cannoli owes 50,000 sugar cubes. FINAL notice given \u2014 pay by tomorrow or leave.\u201d In the margin: \u201cHis medals are CHOCOLATE COINS. The Regiment should know.\u201d","study",B.rd,B.i7,B.ed)
