B.Ie=new A.tN("brew","A Bitter Brew",B.Nl,B.EB,B.HQ,"Mrs. Senclair was about to sign a new will, cutting off her niece Tira and dismissing Graham without a pension for helping Tira pawn her pearls. Graham wrote the plan on his own notepad. At eleven Tira lured her aunt to the cellar while Graham fetched the great espresso urn, and together they tipped it over her. They burnt the note, invented a silver inventory as their alibi, and booked two tickets to Biscotti Bay.",B.FU)
